{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>travis, the frog is a lightning-fast 2D speedrunning game where you play as a frog on a skateboard, armed with a pistol.</i>\u00a0<i>Race through beautiful pixelated levels as fast as you possibly can, and help travis regain his humanity.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554160/extras/gif1.gif?t=1752629886\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f 16/64 levels \ud83d\udef9</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>spanned across 8 vibrant biomes with unique mechanics</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83e\udd47 leaderboards</strong>\u00a0\ud83d\udcc8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>race against the world through each concise yet detailed course</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udfb5 a banger soundtrack \ud83c\udfb8</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>an upbeat math-rock/midwest-emo inspired soundtrack with a retro flare inspired by bands like marietta, tiny moving parts, and modern baseball</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udc38 a frog on a skateboard with a gun \ud83d\udd2b</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>what else needs to be said</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554160/extras/gif2.gif?t=1752629886\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3554160?t=1752629886","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554160/c6ac8ad2693716a2d4f201b34374b8c48e5a9d1d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752629886","capsule_image":"https: